s 222 centimeters wide um so yeah we'd want a pole that covers like the whole of the the section along the top of the frame um 222 centimeters might not be entirely exact but that's me measuring it so yeah you get the idea","options":[{"stockCm":300,"cutToMm":2540,"cutPerEndMm":230,"overhangEachSideMm":173.22238446571532,"twoPiece":true,"brackets":3,"fit":"ideal","overallWithFinialsMm":2720,"note":"cut 23 cm off each end"},{"stockCm":240,"cutToMm":null,"cutPerEndMm":0,"overhangEachSideMm":103.22238446571532,"twoPiece":true,"brackets":3,"fit":"tight","overallWithFinialsMm":2580,"note":"use as supplied; a little tight for curtains to clear the glass"}],"timingsMs":{"uploadMs":7047,"handsMs":13915,"measureMs":13915,"windowOutline":1,"framesWithHandsSetAside":2,"draftMs":26593,"totalMs":42867},"models":["sam-3.1","sam-3.1 (video tracking: hands)","muse-voice-transcribe-1.0","muse-spark-1.3"],"widthMm":2193.5552310685694,"heightMm":1351.0064411912026,"spreadMm":19.915732369938723,"framesUsed":6,"heroFrame":4,"handSpan":{"leftPastFrameMm":48.59033982716784,"rightPastFrameMm":562.5891378657739},"draft":{"curtainType":"unknown","chosenStockCm":300,"diameterMm":35,"reply":"Thanks for the video. For your 222 cm frame, with my A4 check at about 219.4 cm, I recommend the 300 cm pole cut down to 254 cm, which leaves about 17.3 cm past the frame each side. You would cut 23 cm off each outer end with a fine tooth saw to keep the join central, and it ships in two pieces with three brackets with the centre one under the join. Full instructions are included.\nThe 240 cm used as supplied would sit about 10.3 cm past the frame each side, which I find a little tight for curtains to clear the glass.\nPlease allow 9 cm at each end for the finials beyond the 254 cm pole length.\nBest wishes, Rob","questions":[]},"fps":3}